Contacting Hewlett-Packard

Outside North America, contact your local Hewlett-Packard dealer.

Inside North America, use the following numbers Monday through Friday:

Locating authorized HP dealers          800 752-0900
       In Canada contact the Customer Information Center 800 387-3867
HP Automated Support Access Program     800 333-1917
       Recorded messages and fax support for hardware and software information
       to provide you answers 24 hours a day. 

Printer Drivers                         303 353-7650

